WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:30.500
This verse

2
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.625
advances the point of the previous verse.

3
00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:36.416
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna said

4
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:39.958
that the mind is both a 
person's friend and enemy.

5
00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:42.291
Now here he explains

6
00:00:42.291 --> 00:00:44.375
for what type of person the mind is a friend,

7
00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:46.375
and whose enemy it is.

8
00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:52.625
Lord Krishna says

9
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:53.666
that for a person who

10
00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:55.791
conquers the mind,

11
00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:57.875
the mind becomes their friend.

12
00:00:57.875 --> 00:00:59.291
And for a person who

13
00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:01.166
cannot conquer the mind,

14
00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:03.625
the mind becomes their enemy.

15
00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:06.625
A controlled mind, like a friend,

16
00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:10.083
will lead toward self-realization 
and contentment.

17
00:01:10.083 --> 00:01:13.583
Whereas an uncontrolled
 mind will repeatedly mislead,

18
00:01:13.583 --> 00:01:15.416
will confuse decisions,

19
00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:18.583
and will trap in material desires.

20
00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:21.916
Understand from this example –

21
00:01:21.916 --> 00:01:23.500
a kitchen knife

22
00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.208
helps in cutting vegetables and cooking food,

23
00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:30.708
but if someone doesn't know how to handle it,

24
00:01:30.708 --> 00:01:34.583
that same knife can also cause wounds.

25
00:01:34.583 --> 00:01:36.708
The mind is also like an extremely powerful

26
00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:40.125
tool which has the capabilities 
of both creating something new

27
00:01:40.125 --> 00:01:43.541
and destroying.

28
00:01:43.541 --> 00:01:45.500
Now it depends on the person

29
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.500
whether they learn the right use of this tool

30
00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:49.541
or not.

31
00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:52.916
If the mind is disciplined and used properly,

32
00:01:52.916 --> 00:01:54.125
it will become a means

33
00:01:54.125 --> 00:01:57.583
of clarity, concentration, and inner peace.

34
00:01:57.583 --> 00:01:58.541
Such a person

35
00:01:58.541 --> 00:02:00.750
will be capable of taking 
their thoughts and actions

36
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.541
in the right direction of progress.

37
00:02:03.541 --> 00:02:06.541
However, if the mind remained uncontrolled,

38
00:02:06.541 --> 00:02:09.166
it will confuse thoughts and decisions,

39
00:02:09.166 --> 00:02:10.750
will start producing

40
00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:12.458
disturbing imaginations.

41
00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:14.875
Will push a person toward desires.

42
00:02:14.875 --> 00:02:18.166
And all this is certainly the path of harm.

43
00:02:18.166 --> 00:02:21.208
For this reason, Krishna says in clear words

44
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:23.458
that victory over and control of the mind

45
00:02:23.458 --> 00:02:25.208
is extremely essential.

46
00:02:25.208 --> 00:02:27.791
It cannot be ignored.

47
00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:30.541
And if victory over the mind is achieved,

48
00:02:30.541 --> 00:02:33.666
then this very victory will become
 the door to connecting with God

49
00:02:33.666 --> 00:02:36.666
and will pave the path of progress.

50
00:02:36.666 --> 00:02:39.166
This sixth chapter of the Gita – Dhyana

51
00:02:39.166 --> 00:02:42.541
Yoga, is extremely important in this context

52
00:02:42.541 --> 00:02:45.541
because through meditation and yoga the mind

53
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:47.666
can be controlled

54
00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:51.791
and made into a friend.

55
00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.208
A person's

56
00:02:57.208 --> 00:03:00.458
mind is extremely powerful.

57
00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:04.500
It can lift them to the heights of the sky,

58
00:03:04.500 --> 00:03:09.791
but it can also throw them into the depths.

59
00:03:09.791 --> 00:03:13.166
If you control it,

60
00:03:13.166 --> 00:03:16.833
provide it right knowledge and education,

61
00:03:16.833 --> 00:03:19.166
then it is your friend.

62
00:03:19.166 --> 00:03:22.583
But if you let it get trapped in material desires

63
00:03:22.583 --> 00:03:26.333
and cravings,

64
00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:29.000
then it is your enemy.

65
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.750
It can harm you.

66
00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:36.041
It can surround you with sorrow and restlessness.

67
00:03:36.041 --> 00:03:40.375
And at the same time, 
the mind is also extremely restless.

68
00:03:40.375 --> 00:03:43.708
It won't sit idle, it will always

69
00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:49.125
be eager to do something or the other.

70
00:03:49.125 --> 00:03:53.041
If you don't engage it in positive work,

71
00:03:53.041 --> 00:03:56.541
don't keep it busy with good thoughts,

72
00:03:56.541 --> 00:03:58.958
then it will be attracted to bad thoughts

73
00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:03.041
and material cravings,

74
00:04:03.041 --> 00:04:06.833
and will take you in that direction too.

75
00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:10.041
In such a case, you will remain

76
00:04:10.041 --> 00:04:13.791
a mere slave of the mind

77
00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:17.416
and will only move toward harm.

78
00:04:17.416 --> 00:04:20.541
Now the decision is yours –

79
00:04:20.541 --> 00:04:23.583
will you conquer the mind, or

80
00:04:23.583 --> 00:04:25.375
will you

81
00:04:25.375 --> 00:04:28.500
remain its slave?

82
00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:32.958
There are many ways to conquer the mind.

83
00:04:32.958 --> 00:04:37.041
Through yoga you can keep it calm.

84
00:04:37.041 --> 00:04:39.833
By reading books related to
 personal development,

85
00:04:39.833 --> 00:04:43.333
you can take it in the right direction.

86
00:04:43.333 --> 00:04:47.375
Also, by going into the depths of spirituality,

87
00:04:47.375 --> 00:04:50.666
you can bring it under control.

88
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:52.791
This knowledge of the Gita

89
00:04:52.791 --> 00:04:55.958
will keep the mind away from material desires.

90
00:04:55.958 --> 00:04:58.625
If you pay attention to these things,

91
00:04:58.625 --> 00:05:02.541
then just see, this same mind

92
00:05:02.541 --> 00:05:05.750
will prove extremely

93
00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:08.375
helpful in your personal life.

94
00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:16.166
Parents always want

95
00:05:16.166 --> 00:05:18.916
their children to walk on the right path,

96
00:05:18.916 --> 00:05:21.958
to progress, to remain safe from sorrows.

97
00:05:21.958 --> 00:05:25.916
And for this, parents work hard,

98
00:05:25.916 --> 00:05:26.916
get their children

99
00:05:26.916 --> 00:05:30.416
admitted to the best schools,

100
00:05:30.416 --> 00:05:34.125
provide education and care.

101
00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:36.041
However,

102
00:05:36.041 --> 00:05:39.291
while teaching social skills,

103
00:05:39.291 --> 00:05:42.416
they sometimes forget

104
00:05:42.416 --> 00:05:46.916
that more important than all of these

105
00:05:46.916 --> 00:05:52.500
is the protection of their children's minds.

106
00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:53.583
Parents won't be able to

107
00:05:53.583 --> 00:05:56.875
support in every situation,

108
00:05:56.875 --> 00:05:58.708
but the mind

109
00:05:58.708 --> 00:06:00.916
will always be with them.

110
00:06:00.916 --> 00:06:03.416
So if children's minds remain strong,

111
00:06:03.416 --> 00:06:05.000
full of proper life values

112
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:08.333
and spirituality,

113
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:10.083
then understand this –

114
00:06:10.083 --> 00:06:13.750
they will have a friend

115
00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:18.416
who will always lead them in the right direction.

116
00:06:18.416 --> 00:06:21.166
And on the contrary, no matter how many

117
00:06:21.166 --> 00:06:24.500
social skills one acquires,

118
00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:27.958
but if their mind remained uncontrolled,

119
00:06:27.958 --> 00:06:32.541
it will become an enemy and 
lead them on the wrong path.

120
00:06:32.541 --> 00:06:35.125
Not just physical cleanliness,

121
00:06:35.125 --> 00:06:38.875
teach children cleanliness of the mind too.

122
00:06:38.875 --> 00:06:41.458
You yourself become an example of this.

123
00:06:41.458 --> 00:06:44.583
Do good deeds, keep good thoughts.

124
00:06:44.583 --> 00:06:48.083
Extend your hand to help others.

125
00:06:48.083 --> 00:06:51.583
Discuss all these things at home.

126
00:06:51.583 --> 00:06:53.958
And yes,

127
00:06:53.958 --> 00:06:55.791
as parents,

128
00:06:55.791 --> 00:07:00.166
you won't always be able to stay
 with your children.

129
00:07:00.166 --> 00:07:01.750
They will grow up.

130
00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.958
Face challenges

131
00:07:03.958 --> 00:07:06.791
and make their own decisions.

132
00:07:06.791 --> 00:07:08.250
This is where their mind

133
00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:11.208
will play an important role.

134
00:07:11.208 --> 00:07:13.833
If they are given the right,

135
00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:17.083
spiritual education and values from a young age,

136
00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:20.583
then when they grow up, 
this mind will protect them from greed,

137
00:07:20.583 --> 00:07:22.250
social pressure,

138
00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:25.583
lust, and many such dangers.

139
00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:30.208
It will keep them away from wrong decisions.

140
00:07:30.208 --> 00:07:32.166
If your child's mind

141
00:07:32.166 --> 00:07:37.041
is clean, under control, then throughout life

142
00:07:37.041 --> 00:07:40.958
it is a well-wisher who will support them.

143
00:07:45.416 --> 00:07:47.625
In professional life,

144
00:07:47.625 --> 00:07:51.875
your mind is like a companion.

145
00:07:51.875 --> 00:07:54.083
A companion

146
00:07:54.083 --> 00:07:57.375
who helps in making decisions, in guidance,

147
00:07:57.375 --> 00:08:02.125
and in facing challenges.

148
00:08:02.125 --> 00:08:04.541
But it's not necessary

149
00:08:04.541 --> 00:08:07.875
that everything the mind says is right.

150
00:08:07.875 --> 00:08:11.291
If it remained uncontrolled,

151
00:08:11.291 --> 00:08:13.541
this same mind

152
00:08:13.541 --> 00:08:15.833
can also develop habits of fear, worry,

153
00:08:15.833 --> 00:08:18.791
and harmful thoughts,

154
00:08:18.791 --> 00:08:20.500
which will obstruct

155
00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:24.708
your professional progress.

156
00:08:24.708 --> 00:08:28.083
Understand it like this – the mind

157
00:08:28.083 --> 00:08:30.583
is a vehicle

158
00:08:30.583 --> 00:08:34.041
that can take you anywhere.

159
00:08:34.041 --> 00:08:37.500
If you know how to drive this vehicle,

160
00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:41.333
it will take you to your destination.

161
00:08:41.333 --> 00:08:43.250
But

162
00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:47.625
if you can't control it,

163
00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:51.041
it will become the cause of an accident.

164
00:08:51.041 --> 00:08:52.625
If you accept everything

165
00:08:52.625 --> 00:08:55.750
the mind says without thinking,

166
00:08:55.750 --> 00:08:59.583
the possibility of wrong decisions increases.

167
00:08:59.583 --> 00:09:02.791
But if you make every decision thoughtfully,

168
00:09:02.791 --> 00:09:06.125
don't rush,

169
00:09:06.125 --> 00:09:09.583
then this same mind will gradually

170
00:09:09.583 --> 00:09:11.333
start getting trained to make

171
00:09:11.333 --> 00:09:14.041
right decisions too.

172
00:09:14.041 --> 00:09:15.666
So just

173
00:09:15.666 --> 00:09:17.541
two things are essential:

174
00:09:17.541 --> 00:09:20.333
Give it training –

175
00:09:20.333 --> 00:09:24.416
this happens by making thoughtful decisions.

176
00:09:24.416 --> 00:09:28.041
Every time, ask yourself this question –

177
00:09:28.041 --> 00:09:31.041
am I making this decision

178
00:09:31.041 --> 00:09:33.208
under impulse, or greed,

179
00:09:33.208 --> 00:09:36.500
or some temptation?

180
00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:37.666
Also,

181
00:09:37.666 --> 00:09:42.041
stay with experienced people, 
keep learning from them.

182
00:09:42.041 --> 00:09:43.583
Second,

183
00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:46.125
make the mind positive –

184
00:09:46.125 --> 00:09:49.541
for this, live in a positive environment.

185
00:09:49.541 --> 00:09:52.666
Turn toward spirituality.

186
00:09:52.666 --> 00:09:56.333
Definitely spend some time
 of the day in meditation.

187
00:09:56.333 --> 00:09:59.583
Many times, in the burden of work, in professional

188
00:09:59.583 --> 00:10:03.208
pressure, the mind makes a lot of noise.

189
00:10:03.208 --> 00:10:05.541
Causes restlessness.

190
00:10:05.541 --> 00:10:09.750
If you develop the habit of meditation,

191
00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:12.916
you will be able to calm this noise.

192
00:10:12.916 --> 00:10:16.291
You will be able to make 
right professional decisions.
